      "description": "DISSOLVED 2026-08-16 - are Swarm feed writes owner-only, or can anyone with a mined key write? Both: a feed's owner key is private (one writer) while gsocMine() derives a shared key from a fixed public seed (many writers). Same SOC primitive, different key custody. Full adjudication: bai/tension 489b1483 in /ops/.",
